<text id="card0label" x="920" y="340" size="22" color="#38BDF8" text="01 / THE IDEA"/>
<text id="card0title" x="920" y="415" size="37" color="#F3F6FC" text="A search with a way back"/>
<text id="card0body" x="920" y="505" size="29" color="#B9C8DC" text="Fill an empty cell.&#10;If a choice causes a dead end,&#10;undo it and try the next possibility."/>
<effect target="card0label" name="fadeIn" start="0.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card0label" name="fadeOut" start="8.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card0title" name="fadeIn" start="0.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card0title" name="fadeOut" start="8.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card0body" name="fadeIn" start="0.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card0body" name="fadeOut" start="8.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<speak id="card0" start="0.40" max-end="8.60">Backtracking tries a choice, explores its consequences, and undoes choices that lead to a dead end.</speak>
<text id="card9label" x="920" y="340" size="22" color="#38BDF8" text="02 / CHECK THE RULES"/>
<text id="card9title" x="920" y="415" size="37" color="#F3F6FC" text="Row. Column. Box."/>
<text id="card9body" x="920" y="505" size="29" color="#B9C8DC" text="Every digit from 1 to 9 appears&#10;once in each row, each column&#10;and each three by three box."/>
<effect target="card9label" name="fadeIn" start="9.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card9label" name="fadeOut" start="17.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card9title" name="fadeIn" start="9.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card9title" name="fadeOut" start="17.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card9body" name="fadeIn" start="9.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card9body" name="fadeOut" start="17.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<speak id="card9" start="9.40" max-end="17.60">Check three rules: no repeated digit in a row, a column, or a three by three box.</speak>
<text id="card18label" x="920" y="340" size="22" color="#38BDF8" text="03 / MAKE A CHOICE"/>
<text id="card18title" x="920" y="415" size="37" color="#F3F6FC" text="Try 1 at row 1, column 5"/>
<text id="card18body" x="920" y="505" size="29" color="#B9C8DC" text="The legal candidates are 1 and 7.&#10;Our solver tries the smaller one first.&#10;Legal now does not mean solved later."/>
<effect target="card18label" name="fadeIn" start="18.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card18label" name="fadeOut" start="26.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card18title" name="fadeIn" start="18.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card18title" name="fadeOut" start="26.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card18body" name="fadeIn" start="18.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card18body" name="fadeOut" start="26.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<speak id="card18" start="18.40" max-end="26.60">This cell allows one or seven. Try one first. It is legal now, but might cause problems later.</speak>
<text id="card27label" x="920" y="340" size="22" color="#38BDF8" text="04 / FIND THE DEAD END"/>
<text id="card27title" x="920" y="415" size="37" color="#F3F6FC" text="The next cell has no option"/>
<text id="card27body" x="920" y="505" size="29" color="#B9C8DC" text="Row 1, column 8 needs a 1:&#10;its column already contains a 7.&#10;But our trial 1 now blocks the row."/>
<effect target="card27label" name="fadeIn" start="27.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card27label" name="fadeOut" start="36.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card27title" name="fadeIn" start="27.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card27title" name="fadeOut" start="36.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card27body" name="fadeIn" start="27.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card27body" name="fadeOut" start="36.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<speak id="card27" start="27.40" max-end="36.60">The highlighted cell needs one: its column already contains seven. Our trial one blocks the row. No candidate remains.</speak>
<text id="card37label" x="920" y="340" size="22" color="#38BDF8" text="05 / BACKTRACK"/>
<text id="card37title" x="920" y="415" size="37" color="#F3F6FC" text="Undo the last trial"/>
<text id="card37body" x="920" y="505" size="29" color="#B9C8DC" text="Erase the 1 we just placed.&#10;Return to the earlier decision.&#10;The original clues stay untouched."/>
<effect target="card37label" name="fadeIn" start="37.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card37label" name="fadeOut" start="45.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card37title" name="fadeIn" start="37.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card37title" name="fadeOut" start="45.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card37body" name="fadeIn" start="37.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card37body" name="fadeOut" start="45.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<speak id="card37" start="37.40" max-end="45.60">Backtrack: erase our trial one and return to the previous decision. Never change the original clues.</speak>
<text id="card46label" x="920" y="340" size="22" color="#38BDF8" text="06 / TRY THE ALTERNATIVE"/>
<text id="card46title" x="920" y="415" size="37" color="#F3F6FC" text="Try 7 instead"/>
<text id="card46body" x="920" y="505" size="29" color="#B9C8DC" text="Row 1, column 5 now contains 7.&#10;That leaves 1 available in column 8.&#10;The search can move forward again."/>
<effect target="card46label" name="fadeIn" start="46.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card46label" name="fadeOut" start="54.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card46title" name="fadeIn" start="46.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card46title" name="fadeOut" start="54.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card46body" name="fadeIn" start="46.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card46body" name="fadeOut" start="54.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<speak id="card46" start="46.40" max-end="54.60">Try seven instead. One is now available for the next empty cell. This branch can continue.</speak>
<text id="card55label" x="920" y="340" size="22" color="#38BDF8" text="07 / CONTINUE RECURSIVELY"/>
<text id="card55title" x="920" y="415" size="37" color="#F3F6FC" text="The same rule, at every cell"/>
<text id="card55body" x="920" y="505" size="29" color="#B9C8DC" text="Choose an empty cell.&#10;Try a legal digit and recurse.&#10;Undo it if that branch fails."/>
<effect target="card55label" name="fadeIn" start="55.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card55label" name="fadeOut" start="65.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card55title" name="fadeIn" start="55.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card55title" name="fadeOut" start="65.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card55body" name="fadeIn" start="55.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card55body" name="fadeOut" start="65.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<speak id="card55" start="55.40" max-end="65.60">The recursive solver continues through the remaining cells. Each placement is calculated. If another branch failed, it would backtrack again.</speak>
<text id="card66label" x="920" y="340" size="22" color="#38BDF8" text="08 / SOLVED"/>
<text id="card66title" x="920" y="415" size="37" color="#F3F6FC" text="A complete, valid board"/>
<text id="card66body" x="920" y="505" size="29" color="#B9C8DC" text="All rows, columns and boxes agree.&#10;Try → explore → undo if needed.&#10;That is the backtracking pattern."/>
<effect target="card66label" name="fadeIn" start="66.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card66label" name="fadeOut" start="77.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card66title" name="fadeIn" start="66.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card66title" name="fadeOut" start="77.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card66body" name="fadeIn" start="66.0000" duration="0.1200"/>
<effect target="card66body" name="fadeOut" start="77.7800" duration="0.1200"/>
<speak id="card66" start="66.40" max-end="77.60">Solved. Every row, column, and box obeys the rules. Try, explore, and undo if needed. That is backtracking.</speak>
</scene></edu-video>
